  "description": "An Entity Framework Core integration for CQRSharp: a durable IOutboxStore (leased claims, ordered partitions, retries, dead letters, retention), an IInboxStore, an IIdempotencyStore with claim tokens, payload fingerprints and result replay, and a unit of work over the DbContext (UseEntityFrameworkCoreUnitOfWork<TContext>()) that commits a request's changes with its outbox messages. Each target framework is built against its own EF Core major: net8.0 against EF Core 8, net9.0 against EF Core 9, net10.0 against EF Core 10. EF Core uses runtime query compilation, so this package is not Native-AOT or full-trim compatible.",
  "iconFile": "CQRSharp_Icon.png",
  "id": "CQRSharp.EntityFrameworkCore",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-10-07T19:53:54.42Z",
