  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Version 5.1.0. The EF Core outbox store holds notifications scheduled for later delivery (ISchedulingOutboxStore) in its existing columns: no migration from 5.0, and 5.0 and 5.1 instances can share the table.\n            See https://github.com/BisocM/CQRSharp/blob/v5.1.0/CHANGELOG.md for the full notes; upgrading from 5.0 needs no code or schema change.",
